==== Serial ====

The serial port on this device is fairly accessible and consists of 4 through-holes:

<a2s>
  4   3   2   1
#----------------#
|.-. .-. .-. .-. |
|'-' '-' '-' '-' |
#----------------#
         J1
</a2s>

